<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 9-mth oil import bill up to $1.951 bln.</title>
<headline>Philippine 9-mth oil import bill up to $1.951 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' net oil import bill for the first nine months of the year rose by 11.8 percent to $1.951 billion from $1.745 billion during the same period last year, Energy Minister Francisco Viray told reporters on Thursday.</p>
</text>
